                        "name": "meghan1006",
                        "email": "Meghana.H@arm.com",
                        "username": "meghan1006"
                    },
                    "message": "When CHANGE_BAUD_RATE_AT_BL2=1, should the active UART owner set the console back to DEFAULT_CONSOLE_BAUD_RATE before waiting for BL2? Otherwise, if the previous boot left the console at 57600, the next boot starts with the BMC console still at 57600 and BL1/ROM output at 115200 is lost.\n\nHow do we handle this case?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-evb/meta-evb-arm/meta-evb-fvp-base/recipes-extended/baud-rate-changer/baud-rate-changer/baud-rate-changer.sh",
                    "line": 163,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Manoj Kumar Prabakaran",
                        "email": "manojkumar.prabakaran@arm.com",
                        "username": "manojpr97"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                }
